Ravilo — :ravilo-player module
===============================

This module links one GPL-3.0 component and is the GPL-containment boundary for Ravilo's
Android build. Only :ravilo-android depends on this module; :ravilo-ui and :ravilo-web do not.

Bundled GPL-3.0 component:

  org.jellyfin.media3:media3-ffmpeg-decoder
    Prebuilt AndroidX Media3 FFmpeg audio decoder extension (DTS / TrueHD / AC3 / E-AC3).
    Upstream: https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin-androidx-media
    License:  GPL-3.0-only (the bundled FFmpeg is built with GPL codecs)

The whole jellystructure repository is licensed GPL-3.0 (see the root LICENSE), so combining this
component into the Android application is license-compatible. Preserve this NOTICE and the upstream
copyright/license when redistributing the APK.
